{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちはるーむへようこそﾟﾟ\\(´O`/)°゜ﾟ♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2014/04/27/6643094/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かっぱ口"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2014/04/27/6643094/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"遅くなったけど、先日あった横浜での個別握手会！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すごく楽しかったし、\n来てくれた方に感謝ですヽ(；；)丿"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当にありがとうヽ(；；)丿"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もっと来て欲しいなんてわがまま聞いてくれないよね？(｡-_-｡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私服"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2014/04/27/6643094/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2014/04/27/6643094/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"探偵風！いいこちゃん風！\nちょっとボーイッシュ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつもと違う感じが新鮮でいいねっ！\nって褒めてもらえて嬉しかった(｡-_-｡)♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2014/04/27/6643094/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Happy♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(Ӧ)(ӧ)(Ӧ)(Ӧ)(ӧ)〜♬(Ӧ)(ӧ)(Ӧ)(Ӧ)(ӧ)〜♬"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしていくちゃん。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いくちゃん次のシングルお休みということで\n逆に今までよく両立頑張ってたな！って位いくちゃんは両立大変で、\n休憩時間とかずっと勉強してたり\nひめたんもよく言うように鍵盤のシート持って来て練